Feral Spirits Die
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Spirit Wolf (Level 1)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Dire Wolf (Level 2)
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Shadow Wolf (Level 3)
    Actions
        -------- Remove Dead Wolf from Group --------
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_WolfCV = (Custom value of (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet FeralSpirits_Summoner[FeralSpirits_WolfCV] = No unit
        Unit Group - Remove (Triggering unit) from FeralSpirits_WolfGroup.
        -------- Disable Follow Trigger if No Wolves Exist --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in FeralSpirits_WolfGroup) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off Feral Spirits Follow <gen>
            Else - Actions
